config DVB_TANGO_PTI
	tristate "STx7108 TANGO transport processor and TS inputs"
	depends on CPU_SUBTYPE_STX7108
	select FW_LOADER
	help
	  Live TS inputs (STFE) and hardware PID filtering on the TANGO
	  transport processor of the STx7108.  The processor runs the
	  Transport Engine firmware, loaded with request_firmware().

	  The DVB adapters are created by the board driver on top of it.
